So, the UE will perform the actions specified in clause 5.3.10.3, including:

- Reset MAC for the target PCell and release the MAC configuration for the target PCell
- Release RLC entities and associated logical channels for the target PCell for each DAPS bearer
- Reconfigure PDCP entities to release DAPS for each DAPS bearer
- Handle SRBs (release RLC entity, PDCP entity for target PCell, etc.)
- Release physical channel configuration for the target PCell
- Discard keys used in the target PCell.

